{"parse": {"title": "春日迟-02", "pageid": 134674, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%98%A5%E6%97%A5%E8%BF%9F-01\" title=\"春日迟-01\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">春日迟-02</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%98%A5%E6%97%A5%E8%BF%9F-03\" title=\"春日迟-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">春日迟</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">02</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.95.85.E5.B1.B1\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"故山\">故山</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 故山</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Mountain in Her Memory</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_4_bg_08.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_4_bg_08\"><img alt=\"3_4_bg_08\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/Cg-3_4_bg_08.png/600px-Cg-3_4_bg_08.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/Cg-3_4_bg_08.png/900px-Cg-3_4_bg_08.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/Cg-3_4_bg_08.png/1200px-Cg-3_4_bg_08.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>鹭鸶剪？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>……鹭鸶剪！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>师姐？你不是明天才回来吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>我不在的这几日，你又做了什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>我在山上还能做什么？不外乎早晚功课，依时诵经……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>我不是问这些。来时我看到师父在中庭不住叹气，难道跟你没关系？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>咳咳……师父有事问我，我只是如实相告嘛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>师姐叹了一口气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>唉，如实相告。你是怎么如实相告的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>昨日早课前，师父如往常一般教诲了大家好久好久，又突然挨个问我们往后有何打算。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>二师兄的志向还是那样。他喜欢剑术，立志要苦练一番，把咱们白马派的剑发扬光大。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>你是知道师父的——“我派法剑，并非好勇斗狠的凶器！”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>喏，我学得像不像？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>……自然，没人比你惹他发火的次数更多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>三师兄立刻站出来，说修道之人最要紧是无为，要修己心，自吕祖以来就是如此，所谓人能常清静，天地悉皆归嘛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>——气得师父背着手在原地转来转去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>唉，你们真是不教人省心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>师姐，你真了解师父，他就是这么说的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鹭鸶剪清了清嗓子，两手背在背后。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>“咳咳，你们愿意同我讲实话，这很好，但我辈中人，一己的修行毕竟是小道，短了些眼界。像你们师姐，心境就开阔得多，堪为我派的表率……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>师父夸了你许多，我正听得高兴，他却突然让我也说说！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>——于是你便告诉他，你打算下山去，卖绿豆糕？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>咦，师姐已经知道了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>唉。我还没进山门，二师弟就候着我告了你一状。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一直板着面孔的道人微微一笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>说来，你上回不是还想下山卖桃酥吗，怎么又成了绿豆糕？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>后来我又深思熟虑一番，桃酥自然美味，但还得把控火候，实在费时费力……唉，我总做不出那样脆的酥皮。绿豆糕就容易多啦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>鹭鸶剪，你想得还真多啊……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>当然啦，既然在山上修行得全神贯注，山下的日子自然也应该如此。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>不是说道蕴于万物吗，二师兄练剑，三师兄修他的心性，我卖绿豆糕，或许来日都能悟出些什么呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>难怪师父气得不轻。练剑的练剑、吃书的吃书，还有你这个总想着做小买卖的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>白马派出得武举、秀才，连游手也有人选，偏就无人想着继承师门心法，接过镇压揽诸的重任。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>怎么没有？师姐你不就是嘛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>我……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>对呀。师父是最喜欢你的，平日咱们白马派的事务也都是你在打理，师门的衣钵，自然也要你来继承。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>我……我是不成的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>看护揽诸……嗯，这是我辈中人的责任，我和你师兄们自然不会推辞。只是，各人禀赋终究不同……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她摇了摇头，微笑中多了几分怅然。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>罢了，不说这些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>我从山下带了新鲜桃酥，原本还担心你不喜欢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一只手飞快地伸了过来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>——就是这个味道！唉，我怎么做不出来？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>看来桃酥中的大道已然于我无缘，不知绿豆糕中的大道又待如何……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>绿豆糕中的大道，还是等你明天亲自尝了再说吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-314101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-314101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-314101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>明天？师姐，你要带我去山下玩吗？！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_4_at_31.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_4_at_31\"><img alt=\"3_4_at_31\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/83/Cg-3_4_at_31.png/600px-Cg-3_4_at_31.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/83/Cg-3_4_at_31.png/900px-Cg-3_4_at_31.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/83/Cg-3_4_at_31.png/1200px-Cg-3_4_at_31.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>——是有事要下山去办。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>还有，以后别在师父面前说那些要卖窗花、卖吃食的话了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314111.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314111.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314111.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314111.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314111.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314111.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314111.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314111.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>好，那我只跟你说。不过，为什么呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>他对你……向来有很深的期待。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>听了这样的话，难免会伤心的。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_4_bg_19.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_4_bg_19\"><img alt=\"3_4_bg_19\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/Cg-3_4_bg_19.png/600px-Cg-3_4_bg_19.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/Cg-3_4_bg_19.png/900px-Cg-3_4_bg_19.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/Cg-3_4_bg_19.png/1200px-Cg-3_4_bg_19.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一勺热油浇在豆腐上，葱花与辣椒的香气瞬时冲进鼻腔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>啊——啊嚏！这豆腐上，是该有白毛的吗……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"622401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-622401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-622401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"622401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-622401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-622401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-622401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-622401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伙计：</div><div>姑娘放心吧，离了涣州，别处还没有这毛豆腐呢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>尝着倒是不错。鹭鸶剪，你，你试试……啊——啊嚏！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>唔，和我从前吃过的那些豆腐，味道似乎没什么不同。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>你不喜欢吗？那我再叫些别的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>没事没事，是我嘴笨，吃不出味道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>不行，说好要赔你一桌好筵席，就该作数。劳烦店家——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"622310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-622310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-622310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"622310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-622310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-622310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-622310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-622310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">客栈掌柜：</div><div>可是姑娘，您都叫了八个菜了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>这……你说得也在理。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>看着满满一桌碗碟，阿措有些迟疑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>鹭鸶剪，这些你似乎都不喜欢……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>——那你还愿意帮我的忙吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>红衣道人忍不住笑了笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>好吧，你都这么破费了，我怎么能让你失望？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>你方才说，妖兽揽诸？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>你我都是修道之人，你一定听说过涣州仙人镇抚妖兽的传闻吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>确实听过。你是想让我帮忙镇抚揽诸？唔，这可有些难办……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿措吃了一惊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>……我们哪有那样的神通？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>我只是想问，你知道何谓“气凝”吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>唔，这我也知道，就是不晓得和你说的是不是一回事？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>我只听长辈提起过，如果说得不对，也劳烦你指正。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>无妨，你说。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>揽诸虽被镇压，但余波仍在，涣州难免有些地方气脉凝滞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>气脉凝滞的危害……倒是可大可小，有时无甚紧要，有时却会致使山峦崩裂、河流改道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>但无论大小，总不能任其发展下去，以免酿成大祸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>不错，如今知道此事的人可不多了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>嗯，与仙人有缘者毕竟是少数。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>仙人……？哦，你是说，镇抚揽诸的修道之人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>正是。我家祖上两百年前游历祝县一代，有幸蒙受仙人指点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>虽不抵其万一，但勉强也能窥见气脉中的关窍。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>两百年……竟然过去那么久了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>或许对往来于天地之间的仙人而言，百年也不过弹指一瞬吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>总之，我游历至此，偶然发现附近气脉有凝滞之相，还颇为棘手……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>不知你愿不愿意帮我这个忙？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>你帮了我，如果日后有用得到我的地方，我自然也义不容辞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>虽说你这么厉害，我也不知究竟能帮上什么……但总有机会的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>——好啊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>啊……？你这就答应了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鹭鸶剪敲了敲桌子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>是啊，相逢即是有缘嘛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>何况，照你说的，我们还恰巧都与仙人有另一重缘法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>——这可是比相逢更难得的缘分。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "春日迟-02"}}